         <title>CCDASTRO Workflow Manager 1.1.38</title>
         <description>
            <p>Configurable PixInsight post-processing workflow manager.</p>
            <ul>
               <li>v1.1.38 adds optional registered grayscale nebula masks to LHE and Curves, with inversion and configurable brightness protection</li>
               <li>Repeatable Curves supports contrast, saturation and individual RGB channels</li>
               <li>Optional final contrast and color reviews follow luminance addition and final HDR</li>
               <li>Tools are general-purpose and user-selectable; README and website instructions updated</li>
            </ul>
         </description>
      </package>
